    {
      "text": "Def: f'(x)=(f(x+h)−f(x))/h"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gemensam nämnare i täljaren:"
    },
    {
      "text": "5/(a^2(x+h)) − 5/(a^2 x)"
    },
    {
      "text": "= −5h / (a^2 x(x+h))"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dela med h: −5/(a^2 x(x+h))"
    },
    {
      "text": "h mot 0: −5/(a^2 x^2)",
      "emphasis": true
    },
    {
      "text": "f'(x) = −5/(a^2 x^2)",
